  {
   "beat_id": "B07",
   "act": "OUTRO",
   "shot_type": "CARD",
   "shot_source": "own",
   "shot_motion": "hold",
   "on_screen": [
    "Pass 3 fails when the build is",
    "functionally correct",
    "and needfully wrong."
   ],
   "narration_text": "Pass 3 fails when the build is functionally correct and needfully wrong. Seth's code was correct. His at-a-glance need was not met. The resolution: fix the code \u2014 sort not-yet-submitted first, submitted below, each subgroup in insertion order. New handoff condition: three unsubmitted and three submitted, unsubmitted render above submitted on every refresh. Claude writes a six-line change and one new test. Ten of ten pass. Pass 3: green. The build is done.",
   "estimated_duration": 22,
   "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B07.mp3",
   "actual_duration_s": 22.87,
